Maintainer: Admin <admin@zyphoros.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: zyphoros-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zyphor OS branding: OS name and login banner
 Shows "Zyphor OS" in /etc/os-release (PRETTY_NAME, VARIANT) and on the text
 console login banner (/etc/issue, /etc/issue.net). Debian's originals are
 kept via dpkg-divert and the Zyphor OS versions are regenerated from them
 whenever base-files is upgraded. ID=debian and all version fields stay
 unchanged, so software that detects Debian keeps working.
